
.subckt astra_048_cmos_rising_edge_pulse_generator vdd VSS inp out
CD net2 VSS 500f
CL out VSS 100f
M1 db net2 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 db net2 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 net0 inp vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 net0 db vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 net0 inp net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M6 net1 db VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 out net0 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M8 out net0 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
RD inp net2 10k
.ends astra_048_cmos_rising_edge_pulse_generator
